Work at the office finishes.
I am walking to the bus stop.
A green bus is coming.
I get into the bus.
I sit near the window.
The bus is moving forward.
I look outside.
The sun is setting in Kochi city.
The sky is very beautiful.
I am seeing the shops outside.
Those shops have many colors.
The road is very crowded.
The bus is going slowly.
A good breeze is coming through the window.
My tiredness goes away.
I am relaxing completely.
I feel very peaceful.
